+# Host image rollout runbook (canary + phased rollout)
+
+Overview
+- Build hardened worker AMIs/images with Kata/runsc preinstalled using Packer (ops/node_provision/packer-ubuntu-kata-rollout.pkr.hcl).
+- Use Ansible playbook ops/ansible/rollout_canary_nodes.yml to run a controlled canary rollout.
